888-### 5.6 Garbage collection
889-
890:GC runs while holding the manager-home mutation lock and traverses only a revalidated manager-protected cache root. It marks logical build keys referenced by all valid marker v2 files and in-flight transaction journals, then sweeps unreferenced entries older than the normal grace period. If the cache boundary or a marker cannot be validated safely, GC does not adopt or execute entry content; it retains/quarantines conservatively according to the implementation-specific storage policy and reports the uncertainty. It never uses receipt content alone as proof of provenance or a live consumer.
